@startuml approval-activity
'==============================================================================
' Figure (Chapter II): Activity diagram of the approval workflow.
' From the Approval domain: an ordered set of steps; each approver either
' approves (advance) or rejects / requests changes (interrupt, return to
' initiator). When all steps are approved, the contract becomes Active.
' Render:  plantuml -tpdf approval-activity.puml      (or -tpng)
'==============================================================================
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

start
:Legal Manager initiates approval\n(selects a workflow template\nwith ordered steps);
repeat
  :Notify the current approver;
  :Approver decides on the step;
  if (decision?) then (approve)
  else (reject / request changes)
    :Return the contract to the initiator;
    stop
  endif
repeat while (more steps?) is (yes)
->no;
:All steps approved;
:Set the contract to Active;
stop
@enduml
